]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"fromindex","children":[{"type":"text","value":"fromIndex"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"onevent","children":[{"type":"text","value":"onEvent"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"event"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"index"},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-6","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"code","value":"(): void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"returns-7","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"interface-runstore","text":"Interface: RunStore","level":1},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"appendevent","text":"appendEvent()","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"runid","text":"runId","level":5},{"id":"expectednextindex","text":"expectedNextIndex","level":5},{"id":"event","text":"event","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"deleterun","text":"deleteRun()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"runid-2","text":"runId","level":5},{"id":"reason","text":"reason","level":5},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"getevents","text":"getEvents()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-3","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"runid-3","text":"runId","level":5},{"id":"returns-3","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"getrunstate","text":"getRunState()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-4","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"runid-4","text":"runId","level":5},{"id":"returns-4","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"setrunstate","text":"setRunState()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-5","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"runid-5","text":"runId","level":5},{"id":"state","text":"state","level":5},{"id":"returns-5","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"subscribe","text":"subscribe()?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-6","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"runid-6","text":"runId","level":5},{"id":"fromindex","text":"fromIndex","level":5},{"id":"onevent","text":"onEvent","level":5},{"id":"returns-6","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"returns-7","text":"Returns","level":5}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Interface: RunStore\n\nDefined in: [packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts:572](https://github.com/TanStack/workflow/blob/main/packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts#L572)\n\nPluggable backing store for workflow runs.\n\nTwo surfaces:\n\n  - **State** (`getRunState` / `setRunState` / `deleteRun`) —\n    low-frequency metadata writes (status, output, pause info).\n    State the user mutates inside the handler is NOT persisted\n    here; it's reconstructed from log replay.\n\n  - **Event log** (`appendEvent` / `getEvents`) — append-only\n    with optimistic CAS on `expectedNextIndex`. Each entry is a\n    `WorkflowEvent`. Used for both replay (engine reads\n    checkpoint events back) and transport (UI subscribers tail\n    the log).\n\nStores that support push-based subscription (in-memory, Redis\npub/sub, Postgres LISTEN/NOTIFY, Durable Streams) should\nimplement `subscribe` so callers can tail a run live without\npolling.\n\n## Properties\n\n### appendEvent()\n\n```ts\nappendEvent: (runId, expectedNextIndex, event) => Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts:582](https://github.com/TanStack/workflow/blob/main/packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts#L582)\n\nAppend `event` at `expectedNextIndex`. Throws `LogConflictError`\n if another writer has already committed at that index. Must be\n atomic.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### runId\n\n`string`\n\n##### expectedNextIndex\n\n`number`\n\n##### event\n\n[`WorkflowEvent`](../type-aliases/WorkflowEvent.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### deleteRun()\n\n```ts\ndeleteRun: (runId, reason) => Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts:576](https://github.com/TanStack/workflow/blob/main/packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts#L576)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### runId\n\n`string`\n\n##### reason\n\n[`DeleteReason`](../type-aliases/DeleteReason.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### getEvents()\n\n```ts\ngetEvents: (runId) => Promise<readonly WorkflowEvent[]>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts:588](https://github.com/TanStack/workflow/blob/main/packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts#L588)\n\nRead every event for `runId`, ordered by append position.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### runId\n\n`string`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<readonly [`WorkflowEvent`](../type-aliases/WorkflowEvent.md)[]\\>\n\n***\n\n### getRunState()\n\n```ts\ngetRunState: (runId) => Promise<RunState<unknown, unknown> | undefined>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts:574](https://github.com/TanStack/workflow/blob/main/packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts#L574)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### runId\n\n`string`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`RunState`](RunState.md)\\<`unknown`, `unknown`\\> \\| `undefined`\\>\n\n***\n\n### setRunState()\n\n```ts\nsetRunState: (runId, state) => Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts:575](https://github.com/TanStack/workflow/blob/main/packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts#L575)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### runId\n\n`string`\n\n##### state\n\n[`RunState`](RunState.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### subscribe()?\n\n```ts\noptional subscribe: (runId, fromIndex, onEvent) => () => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts:594](https://github.com/TanStack/workflow/blob/main/packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts#L594)\n\nSubscribe to new events for `runId`. Returns an unsubscribe\n function. Stores without push support omit this and callers\n fall back to polling `getEvents`.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### runId\n\n`string`\n\n##### fromIndex\n\n`number`\n\n##### onEvent\n\n(`event`, `index`) => `void`\n\n#### Returns\n\n```ts\n(): void;\n```\n\n##### Returns\n\n`void`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: RunStore\ntitle: RunStore\n---\n\n# Interface: RunStore\n\nDefined in: [packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts:572](https://github.com/TanStack/workflow/blob/main/packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts#L572)\n\nPluggable backing store for workflow runs.\n\nTwo surfaces:\n\n  - **State** (`getRunState` / `setRunState` / `deleteRun`) —\n    low-frequency metadata writes (status, output, pause info).\n    State the user mutates inside the handler is NOT persisted\n    here; it's reconstructed from log replay.\n\n  - **Event log** (`appendEvent` / `getEvents`) — append-only\n    with optimistic CAS on `expectedNextIndex`. Each entry is a\n    `WorkflowEvent`. Used for both replay (engine reads\n    checkpoint events back) and transport (UI subscribers tail\n    the log).\n\nStores that support push-based subscription (in-memory, Redis\npub/sub, Postgres LISTEN/NOTIFY, Durable Streams) should\nimplement `subscribe` so callers can tail a run live without\npolling.\n\n## Properties\n\n### appendEvent()\n\n```ts\nappendEvent: (runId, expectedNextIndex, event) => Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts:582](https://github.com/TanStack/workflow/blob/main/packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts#L582)\n\nAppend `event` at `expectedNextIndex`. Throws `LogConflictError`\n if another writer has already committed at that index. Must be\n atomic.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### runId\n\n`string`\n\n##### expectedNextIndex\n\n`number`\n\n##### event\n\n[`WorkflowEvent`](../type-aliases/WorkflowEvent.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### deleteRun()\n\n```ts\ndeleteRun: (runId, reason) => Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts:576](https://github.com/TanStack/workflow/blob/main/packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts#L576)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### runId\n\n`string`\n\n##### reason\n\n[`DeleteReason`](../type-aliases/DeleteReason.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### getEvents()\n\n```ts\ngetEvents: (runId) => Promise<readonly WorkflowEvent[]>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts:588](https://github.com/TanStack/workflow/blob/main/packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts#L588)\n\nRead every event for `runId`, ordered by append position.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### runId\n\n`string`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<readonly [`WorkflowEvent`](../type-aliases/WorkflowEvent.md)[]\\>\n\n***\n\n### getRunState()\n\n```ts\ngetRunState: (runId) => Promise<RunState<unknown, unknown> | undefined>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts:574](https://github.com/TanStack/workflow/blob/main/packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts#L574)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### runId\n\n`string`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`RunState`](RunState.md)\\<`unknown`, `unknown`\\> \\| `undefined`\\>\n\n***\n\n### setRunState()\n\n```ts\nsetRunState: (runId, state) => Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts:575](https://github.com/TanStack/workflow/blob/main/packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts#L575)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### runId\n\n`string`\n\n##### state\n\n[`RunState`](RunState.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### subscribe()?\n\n```ts\noptional subscribe: (runId, fromIndex, onEvent) => () => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts:594](https://github.com/TanStack/workflow/blob/main/packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts#L594)\n\nSubscribe to new events for `runId`. Returns an unsubscribe\n function. Stores without push support omit this and callers\n fall back to polling `getEvents`.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### runId\n\n`string`\n\n##### fromIndex\n\n`number`\n\n##### onEvent\n\n(`event`, `index`) => `void`\n\n#### Returns\n\n```ts\n(): void;\n```\n\n##### Returns\n\n`void`\n"}
